+.. _cli_create_database:
+
+Creating an empty database
+==========================
+
+The ``create-database`` command creates a new, empty SQLite database file::
+
+    $ sqlite-utils create-database mydb.db
+
+It will return an error if the file already exists, without modifying that file.
+
